{"id": "113-2-C-012", "year": 113, "session": 2, "subject": "C", "number": 12, "stem": "Dose length product（DLP）與computed tomography dose index（CTDI）是目前臨床常使用於估算病人做\nCT掃描所接受到的輻射劑量，helical CT（or spiral CT）會使用體積（volume）的概念估算輻射劑量，這\n個物理量是volume CTDI或是CTDIvol。如果helical CT 在z-axis掃描長度是 L，則DLP與CTDIvol 與L的數學\n關係，下列何者正確？", "options": {"A": "DLP = CTDIvol + L", "B": "DLP = CTDIvol ｰ L", "C": "DLP = CTDIvol × L", "D": "DLP = CTDIvol ÷ L"}, "answer": "C", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/113_2/33_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
